sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 👤 Candidate
    participant A as 🤖 AI Agent
    participant P as 💼 Provider

    C->>A: Find me a job

    rect rgb(230, 243, 255)
        Note over A,P: Discover
        A->>P: What jobs do you have?
        P-->>A: Job listings + fit scores
    end

    A-->>C: Here are your top matches

    rect rgb(255, 248, 210)
        Note over C,A: Consent
        C->>A: Apply to this one
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over A,P: Apply
        A->>P: Start application
        P-->>A: Screening questions
        A->>P: Submit answers + resume
        P-->>A: Application received ✓
    end

    A-->>C: You're all set!
